"Arrange applications by dragging them. This arrangement returns when "
"alphabetical order is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Korralda rakendusi neid lohistades. See paigutus naaseb, kui tähestikuline "
"järjestus välja lülitatakse."

#: src/deskence/pages.py:866 src/deskence/ui/app-grid-page.ui:32
msgid ""
"The background behind the applications. Icons, names and the search field do "
"not change."
msgstr "Taust rakenduste taga. Ikoonid, nimed ja otsinguväli ei muutu."

#: src/deskence/pages.py:869 src/deskence/pages.py:876
