msgstr "Saadaval, kui Deskence'i dokk on sisse lülitatud."

#: src/deskence/pages.py:873 src/deskence/ui/app-grid-page.ui:94
msgid ""
"Change the look of application groups, such as “Utilities”, in the "
"applications view. Only the tile background changes."
msgstr ""
"Muuda rakenduste vaates rakenduste rühmade, näiteks „Tööriistad“, välimust. "
"Muutub ainult paani taust."

#: src/deskence/pages.py:879 src/deskence/ui/app-grid-page.ui:156
msgid ""
"Choose the background that appears under the pointer on an application or an "
"application folder, also inside an open folder."
msgstr ""
"Vali taust, mis ilmub kursori alla rakendusel või rakenduste kaustal, ka "
"avatud kaustas."

